---
const stages = ['Observe', 'Define', 'Measure', 'Analyze', 'Test', 'Refine'];
---
<section class="section behavior-feature" id="approach" aria-labelledby="behavior-title">
  <div class="container behavior-statement">
    <div class="intro-copy behavior-editorial">
      <p class="eyebrow">Behavior analysis</p>
      <h2 class="behavior-heading" id="behavior-title">
        <span class="behavior-heading-sans">Data reveals</span>
        <em><span>patterns.</span> <span>Care gives them purpose.</span></em>
      </h2>
      <div class="behavior-copy">
        <p>Data helps me understand behavior. Care helps me decide what to build.</p>
        <p>Observe carefully. Define clearly. Respect the person behind every decision.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="behavior-process card">
      <ol class="research-stages" aria-label="Research process">
        {stages.map(stage => <li><span class="research-stage-label">{stage}</span></li>)}
      </ol>
      <p class="behavior-process-note"><em>Patterns</em> become useful when they lead to thoughtful action.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
